@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName sans-serif

title Binary Search Tree (BST) Ordering Invariant

rectangle "Root: [ 50 ]" as N50 #LightSkyBlue
rectangle "Left Subtree: [ 30 ]" as N30 #PaleGreen
rectangle "Right Subtree: [ 70 ]" as N70 #PaleGreen
rectangle "Leaf: [ 20 ]" as N20 #LightYellow
rectangle "Leaf: [ 40 ]" as N40 #LightYellow
rectangle "Leaf: [ 60 ]" as N60 #LightYellow
rectangle "Leaf: [ 80 ]" as N80 #LightYellow

N50 --> N30 : left (keys < 50)
N50 --> N70 : right (keys > 50)

N30 --> N20 : left (keys < 30)
N30 --> N40 : right (keys > 30)

N70 --> N60 : left (keys < 70)
N70 --> N80 : right (keys > 70)

note bottom of N20
  BST Ordering Invariant:
  For every node X:
    All keys in Left(X) < Key(X) < All keys in Right(X)
  Inorder Traversal (L -> Root -> R):
    [ 20, 30, 40, 50, 60, 70, 80 ] (Monotonically Sorted)
  Search / Insert / Delete:
    Average: O(log n) | Worst (Skewed): O(n)
end note

@enduml
